       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is five times the labeled maximum of 200 mg per day for adults. A dose that high risks serotonin syndrome, seizures, and cardiac toxicity. It may be a typo, for example 100 mg entered as 1000 mg.\n\nHere are some options:\n- **Usual starting dose:** 50 mg by mouth once daily. For anxiety disorders or PTSD, start at 25 mg daily.\n- **Dose of 100 mg:** If you meant 100 mg once daily, I can enter that.\n- **Maximum dose:** The most I can enter is 200 mg once daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you really do intend a dose above the labeled maximum, you'll need to talk to pharmacy or the attending. I can't enter it."
